# =============================================================================
# Shared .dockerignore TEMPLATE for Hospital Management System (HMS) images.
# =============================================================================
# This file documents the recommended ignore patterns for building HMS service
# images. It is a TEMPLATE / reference — a `.dockerignore` is only honored at the
# ROOT of a build context, so copy the relevant patterns to:
#   * the repository root  ../../.dockerignore   (backend services build with
#     `context: .` / repo-root context because they depend on the @hms/shared
#     workspace at ../../backend/shared), and
#   * ../../frontend/.dockerignore                (the frontend builds with
#     `context: ./frontend`). The frontend already ships its own .dockerignore.
#
# Goal: keep build contexts small and NEVER leak host node_modules or local
# secrets (.env) into images. (QA/DevOps strategy: "Docker image creation".)

# --- Dependencies (always reinstalled inside the image) ---
node_modules
**/node_modules

# --- Environment & secrets (NEVER bake secrets into an image) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Build output ---
dist
build
out
coverage
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Tests & tooling not needed at runtime ---
**/__tests__
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.jsx
**/*.spec.js
.nyc_output
.eslintcache
playwright-report
test-results

# --- Logs & temp ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
logs
tmp
temp

# --- Version control & CI ---
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- Docker meta (no need to copy into the image) ---
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

# --- Editor / OS cruft ---
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# --- Infra & docs not needed inside service images ---
infrastructure
*.md
**/*.md
